    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>This improved version of the Aiming Accuracy Feat moves your enemy -1 step on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aiming_Accuracy\" title=\"Aiming Accuracy\">Aiming Accuracy</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot\" title=\"Point-Blank Shot\">Point-Blank Shot</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Precise_Shot\" title=\"Precise Shot\">Precise Shot</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aiming_Accuracy\" title=\"Aiming Accuracy\">Aiming Accuracy</a> Feat, a target you damage cannot take the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Recover\" title=\"Recover\">Recover</a> Action until the end of its next turn.</p>",
